WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
Socialism is responsible for 100 million deaths

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.560
More people than Fascism.

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.600
A single rocket

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.530
hitting the center of the city killed 11 people.

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:12.720
It also increases poverty.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:15.840
So why does it appeal to so many people?

00:00:15.849 --> 00:00:18.820
Democratic Socialism is about…

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.800
Young politicians say

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.740
Socialism will help the poor.

00:00:22.740 --> 00:00:25.940
In a modern, moral, and wealthy society,

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:29.080
no person in America should be too poor to live.

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:31.060
That's what I think.

00:00:31.060 --> 00:00:32.440
That seems simple.

00:00:32.440 --> 00:00:33.230
Seems pretty simple! [applause]

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:36.780
Don’t they know that Socialism creates more poverty?

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.720
The oil rich country is now leading Latin America

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.940
in what is called "acute malnutrition."

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:44.840
Even people who understand that Socialism

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:49.200
is bad for the economy may not know that Socialism

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.580
almost always leads to violence.

00:00:51.580 --> 00:00:55.260
120 people were killed during 2017.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.800
Why does Socialism lead to violence?

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.060
Socialism gives absolute power to the state.

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:04.980
No one is allowed to own private property or trade

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:09.740
Yet everywhere under Socialism, people still do.

00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.820
Mary Ann is able to find a listing for diapers,

00:01:11.820 --> 00:01:13.460
The black market online price

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:15.120
is almost 10 dollars cheaper.

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:17.480
People have to trade on the black market to survive.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.940
But then government gets violent.

00:01:19.940 --> 00:01:22.120
They throw some of them in jail.

00:01:22.120 --> 00:01:24.740
My father was a political prisoner for almost a decade

00:01:24.740 --> 00:01:28.260
because in his 20’s he sold soaps and perfumes

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:30.700
and did not want to relinquish all his profits

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:31.900
to the government.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:35.980
Capitalism sucks. Fuck Capitalism.

00:01:35.980 --> 00:01:38.780
Today in America, capitalism is vilified

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:41.620
but if capitalism is so bad

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.560
why hasn’t there been a mass exodus out of America

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:45.860
because of Capitalism?

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:47.160
Sorry, you just don’t see it.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:50.760
Socialism is the perfect excuse for someone

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:53.260
who wants to rule an authoritarian regime.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:56.140
As people rebel against government controls,

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.400
the politicians, to preserve their power,

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:00.760
use violence to stop them.

00:02:00.760 --> 00:02:03.420
They threw me to the floor and they started kicking me

00:02:03.420 --> 00:02:05.160
They tortured him asking

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:07.100
who organized the protests?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.460
How did you answer?

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:11.900
I said the people are just tired of Daniel Ortega.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.320
Ortega has goverened Nicaragua

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:16.360
for 22 of the last 39 years.

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:20.116
In Nicaragua, people have again fallen for Daniel Ortega

00:02:20.120 --> 00:02:21.620
and his Socialist promises.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.540
But under his policies, Nicaragua has gone from

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:31.520
one of Central America's safest countries

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:36.420
to one of the most dangerous.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:39.300
In Venezuela, where there are similar protests.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.700
This man was a mayor in Caracas.

00:02:41.700 --> 00:02:45.080
The Minister of Internal Affairs was calling me

00:02:45.080 --> 00:02:47.880
several times a week asking me to use the

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:50.160
police department that I was in charge of

00:02:50.160 --> 00:02:52.320
to go against protests in Chacao

00:02:57.800 --> 00:02:59.760
The Mayor refused to have his police

00:02:59.760 --> 00:03:03.900
punish the protesters, so he was threatened with jail.

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:05.800
He then escaped to America.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:09.000
Why do you think Venezuela followed the same path

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.920
when we had Cuba's example for decades?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.100
And it was terrible.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.560
It seems to me we are not able to learn.

00:03:15.560 --> 00:03:17.080
They will always be dreaming about the future

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.400
and never delivering.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:22.360
People keep falling in love with that kind of crap.

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:23.620
They do!

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:26.620
Socialism repeateadly leads to violence.

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:29.860
And yet, around the world, people praise it.

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:33.260
I don’t think they realize how deep socialism

00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:34.860
is involved in all that.

00:03:34.860 --> 00:03:37.100
This man fled Nicaragua.

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:38.120
He understands.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:40.720
America is a great country

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:44.180
and people really don't appreciate it much.

00:03:44.180 --> 00:03:47.600
They should travel a little more to poor countries

00:03:47.600 --> 00:03:51.260
to really get a feeling for what they have here

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.000
in the United States.

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:55.700
Look around, just look around, you know?

00:03:55.700 --> 00:04:00.460
And really get some knowledge.

